 "items": [
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent000Text09",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent000Text09",
   "en": "Well, whaddaya know!\nGreat minds think alike, I\nguess.{END}",
   "max_units": 61,
   "units": 61,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent000Text10",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent000Text10",
   "en": "Guess again!\nThis can’t be mere coincidence.{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 50,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent000Text11",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent000Text11",
   "en": "Why, Jiminy?\nDon't tell me that―{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 38,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent000Text12",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent000Text12",
   "en": "I felt it, too!{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 20,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent000Text13",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent000Text13",
   "en": "Gawrsh, maybe it’s contagious.{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 35,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent000Text14",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent000Text14",
   "en": "Or maybe something funny’s\ngoing on!  I think we should\ncheck it out.{END}",
   "max_units": 76,
   "units": 76,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent000Text15",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent000Text15",
   "en": "Okay.{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 10,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent000Text16",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent000Text16",
   "en": "Hey, where are you going?{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 30,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent000Text17",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent000Text17",
   "en": "To check it out!\nWhat's the matter, scared?{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 49,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent000Text18",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent000Text18",
   "en": "D-Don’t be ridiculous!\nCome on, Goofy!{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 44,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent000Text19",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent000Text19",
   "en": "Okay, but we should shut the\ndoor behind us.{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 50,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent000Text20",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent000Text20",
   "en": "Sora!{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 10,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent000Text21",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent000Text21",
   "en": "Who is THAT?!{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 18,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent000Text22",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent000Text22",
   "en": "It must be a Heartless!\nLet’s see how it handles my\nmagic!{END}",
   "max_units": 65,
   "units": 65,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent000Text23",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent000Text23",
   "en": "THUNDER!{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 13,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent000Text24",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent000Text24",
   "en": "Huh?{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 9,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent000Text25",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent000Text25",
   "en": "That’s odd.\nTHUNDER!  THUNDER!!{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 37,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent000Text26",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent000Text26",
   "en": "Umm…  FIRE!\nBlizzard?{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 27,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent000Text27",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent000Text27",
   "en": "I don’t get it.\nWhy isn’t my magic working?{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 49,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent000Text28",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent000Text28",
   "en": "I should think it’s obvious.{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 33,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent000Text29",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent000Text29",
   "en": "The moment you set foot in\nthis castle, you forgot every\nspell and ability you knew…{END}",
   "max_units": 91,
   "units": 91,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent000Text30",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent000Text30",
   "en": "…though the forgetting does\nnot end there.\n\nIn this place, to find is to lose\nand to lose is to find.{END}",
   "max_units": 110,
   "units": 110,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 5
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent000Text31",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent000Text31",
   "en": "That is the way of things in\nCastle Oblivion.{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 51,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent000Text32",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent000Text32",
   "en": "Castle Oblivion?{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 21,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent000Text33",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent000Text33",
   "en": "Yes…\nHere you will meet people you\nknow.  People you miss.{END}",
   "max_units": 65,
   "units": 65,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent000Text34",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent000Text34",
   "en": "Look, there's no one―{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 26,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent000Text35",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent000Text35",
   "en": "Riku!  You mean Riku!\nHe IS here!{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 39,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent000Text36",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent000Text36",
   "en": "Do you want to find him?\nIf you do…{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 41,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent000Text37",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent000Text37",
   "en": "What did you do?{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 21,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent000Text38",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent000Text38",
   "en": "I sampled your memories.\nAnd from them, I made this.{END}",
   "max_units": 58,
   "units": 58,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent000Text39",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent000Text39",
   "en": "This is the key to reuniting\nwith those you hold dear.{END}",
   "max_units": 60,
   "units": 60,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent000Text40",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent000Text40",
   "en": "What is this, a card?{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 26,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent000Text41",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent000Text41",
   "en": "A promise.\nUse that card and press on.\nYou will find your friend.{END}",
   "max_units": 72,
   "units": 72,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent001Text00",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent001Text00",
   "en": "Like this?{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 15,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent001Text01",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent001Text01",
   "en": "Yes.  Go, Sora.\nTo lose and claim anew, or to\nclaim anew only to lose…{END}",
   "max_units": 77,
   "units": 77,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent001Text02",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent001Text02",
   "en": "C’mon, guys―let’s go.{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 26,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent002Text00",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent002Text00",
   "en": "Wait, this can’t be right.\nWe’re in Traverse Town!{END}",
   "max_units": 56,
   "units": 56,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent002Text01",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent002Text01",
   "en": "It isn't reality that you see.{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 35,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent002Text02",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent002Text02",
   "en": "This town is an illusion\nconceived by your memories\ningrained in that card.{END}",
   "max_units": 82,
   "units": 82,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent002Text03",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent002Text03",
   "en": "My memories?{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 17,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent002Text04",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent002Text04",
   "en": "Forget about that, Sora!\nWe’re two heads short!{END}",
   "max_units": 53,
   "units": 53,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent002Text05",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent002Text05",
   "en": "Donald?  Goofy?\nGuys, where are you?{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 42,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent002Text06",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent002Text06",
   "en": "What did you do with them?{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 31,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent002Text07",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent002Text07",
   "en": "They are at the mercy of the\ncards now.\n\nMaster the cards, and their\nstrength will be yours again.{END}",
   "max_units": 107,
   "units": 107,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 5
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent003Text00",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent003Text00",
   "en": "Are you two all right?\nWhere have you been?{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 49,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent003Text01",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent003Text01",
   "en": "You tell us!\nWhen you opened the door,\nthere was this weird light…{END}",
   "max_units": 73,
   "units": 73,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent003Text02",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent003Text02",
   "en": "…and the rest is a big blank.{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 34,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent003Text03",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent003Text03",
   "en": "Well, try to remember what\nhappened.  I need to keep my\njournal up to date.{END}",
   "max_units": 82,
   "units": 82,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent003Text04",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent003Text04",
   "en": "Hey, wait a second…\nDonald, where’d you get the\nnew duds?{END}",
   "max_units": 64,
   "units": 64,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent003Text05",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent003Text05",
   "en": "You too, Goofy!\nSomebody’s been messing with\nour clothes!{END}",
   "max_units": 64,
   "units": 64,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent003Text06",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent003Text06",
   "en": "The cards again?{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 21,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent003Text07",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent003Text07",
   "en": "That is for you to ponder.{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 31,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent003Text08",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent003Text08",
   "en": "Master the cards and make\nyour way through the castle.\nFrom here on, you walk alone.{END}",
   "max_units": 91,
   "units": 91,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent003Text09",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent003Text09",
   "en": "You mean we can’t go with him?\nThat’s not fair!{END}",
   "max_units": 53,
   "units": 53,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent003Text10",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent003Text10",
   "en": "Yeah!  Sora can’t do anything\nwithout our help!{END}",
   "max_units": 53,
   "units": 53,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent003Text11",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent003Text11",
   "en": "Thanks a lot, Donald!{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 26,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent003Text12",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent003Text12",
   "en": "You sure you’ll be okay?{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 29,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent003Text13",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent003Text13",
   "en": "Of course!{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 15,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent003Text14",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent003Text14",
   "en": "You want me to go alone?\nFine.  I can take care of myself.{END}",
   "max_units": 64,
   "units": 64,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent003Text15",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent003Text15",
   "en": "Hmm, the hero speaks boldly.\nGo, then.  The rest of Castle\nOblivion awaits.{END}",
   "max_units": 82,
   "units": 82,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent003Text16",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent003Text16",
   "en": "Walk the avenues of latent\nmemory, and you shall meet\nsomeone dear to you.{END}",
   "max_units": 81,
   "units": 81,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent003Text17",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent003Text17",
   "en": "I have a really bad feeling\nabout this…{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 45,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent003Text18",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent003Text18",
   "en": "Relax, Jiminy.\nI’m ready for any tricks he’s\ngot up his sleeve.{END}",
   "max_units": 70,
   "units": 70,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent003Text19",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent003Text19",
   "en": "How hard can it be to figure\nout these cards?{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 51,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent003Text20",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent003Text20",
   "en": "All I have to do is use one in\nfront of that door over there.{END}",
   "max_units": 67,
   "units": 67,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent003Text21",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent003Text21",
   "en": "You can perform the following\nactions in the field.{END}",
   "max_units": 57,
   "units": 57,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent003Text22",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent003Text22",
   "en": "{HIGHLIGHT}+Control Pad{PLAIN}:  Move\n       {HIGHLIGHT}A Button{PLAIN}:  Swing Keyblade\n       {HIGHLIGHT}B Button{PLAIN}:  Jump{END}",
   "max_units": 136,
   "units": 136,
   "controls": [
    "{END}",
    "{HIGHLIGHT}",
    "{PLAIN}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent003Text23",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent003Text23",
   "en": "To open doors in the field,\nstrike them with your\nKeyblade.{END}",
   "max_units": 66,
   "units": 66,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent004Text00",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent004Text00",
   "en": "Hmm, fighting alone isn’t as\neasy as I thought…{END}",
   "max_units": 53,
   "units": 53,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "event_text:gEvent004Text01",
   "pool": "event_text",
   "symbol": "gEvent004Text01",
   "en": "Aaaah!!\nDon't pop out of nowhere like\nthat!{END}",
   "max_units": 52,
   "units": 50,
